# This repo tracks only the workspace shell: the docs that tell you what belongs here
# and how to assemble it. Everything of substance lives in its own repo or is a local
# artefact.

# ─── Nested project repos: cloned separately, never nested inside this one ───
# Listed here so git treats them as absent rather than turning them into gitlinks
# (an accidental `git add wh11ed` would otherwise create a broken submodule ref).
# See README.md for the clone commands.
/wh11ed/
/wh11ed-api/
/wh-glossary/

# ─── Sources: the folder is tracked, its contents never are ───
# ~5.5 GB of PDFs, images and archives that can't and shouldn't go into git.
# sources/README.md stays tracked so the directory (and its purpose) survives a clone.
/sources/*
!/sources/README.md

# ─── Local tooling ───
.idea/
.vscode/
.claude/settings.local.json

# ─── OS noise ───
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
